## 六、RemoteEvent 清單（詳見 GAME_DESIGN.md 與 default.project.json）

已定義的 RemoteEvent（全部在 `ReplicatedStorage.RemoteEvents`）：

`RequestLoadData` / `LoadDataResponse` / `AddXP` / `LevelUp` / `UpdateCatAppearance` /  
`SelectCat` / `SpawnNPC` / `NPCDied` / `PurchaseCat` / `PurchaseResult` /  
`EquipItem` / `UnequipItem` / `EquipmentChanged` / `BuyEquipment` /  
`UseSkill` / `SkillResult` / `SkillUnlocked` / `CombatHit` / `PlayerDied` / `UpdateUI` /  
`RequestPvP` / `PvPInvite` / `PvPAccepted` / `PvPResult` /  
`SynthesizeCat` / `SynthesisResult` / `UpdateFragments`

RemoteFunction：`GetPlayerData` / `GetShopCatalog`

